Subject: [PATCH] fix(block-entities): render copper golem statue poses

Bedrock stores copper golem statue pose in the block entity Pose integer while its block palette maps every variant to the standing Java state. Translate the validated 0-3 pose values to Java block states, preserving facing, weathering, wax, and waterlogging. Emit only a block update because Java has no copper statue block entity payload.
---
